    EntsAffected         kFoe
    EntsAutoHit          kNone
    Target               kFoe
    Range                40
    EnduranceCost        7.8
    TimeToActivate       1
    TimeToRoot           1
    RechargeTime         20
    EffectArea           kCharacter
    AIReport             kNever
    BoostsAllowed        kAccuracy_Boost, kRecharge_Boost, kRange_Boost, kEnduranceDiscount_Boost, kConfuse_Boost
    StrengthsDisallowed  kRange
    HighlightEval        kDD_StatusMode_1 Mode? !
    HighlightRing        255 192 255 255
    VisualFX             "menu\Powers\AnimFX\PlayerPowers\PsionicMelee_Boggle.PFX"
